# Centaur Warchief — a Two-color greater enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 7/12 Two-color greater enemies — 20 life, bribe 100 gold
# enemy: Centaur Warchief (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0897.dck "Centaur Warchief (Re/Wh, 4th)" [Tier 3 —
#   Manalink 3 file dated 2016-02-15; its first 16 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 16
#   lines (60 cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/centaur_warchief.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level
#   7) [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/centaur_warchief.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Greater) — "Centaur Warchief"
#   (Original) [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Centaur Warchief
12 Plains
12 Mountain
4 Serra Angel
4 Yotian Soldier
2 Wall of Swords
3 Smoke
2 Eternal Warrior
2 Lightning Bolt
2 Healing Salve
3 Kismet
2 Colossus of Sardia
2 Cave People
2 Ali Baba
2 Dragon Whelp
2 Savannah Lions
1 Land Tax
3 Swords to Plowshares
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   3 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vBlack  2 Kormus Bell, 1 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vBlue   2 Magnetic Mountain, 1 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vGreen  3 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vRed    3 Swords to Plowshares
#   .vWhite  3 Swords to Plowshares
SB: 2 Kormus Bell
SB: 2 Magnetic Mountain
